### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "themeuser",
  "email": "themeuser@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "themeuser",
  "password": "secret123"
}
### Get user info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/user/1

### Get theme
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/theme

### Set theme to dark
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/theme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "dark"
}

### Verify theme changed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/theme
